1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The Clover Kingdom.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
In this place where magic is everything,

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
there lives one boy who was born without it.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
His name is Asta.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
His strength and determination helped him become a magic knight,

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
and despite the many challenges he faces,

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
he aims for the top and refuses to give up.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Rich or poor, royalty or commoner,

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Asta believes anyone can shine.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
His mission is to prove that to the whole world,

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
and to become the next Wizard King.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,000
It's finally time for us to go and train in the Heart Kingdom.

13
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
I swore I'd become worthy of Lady Phinnes' love

14
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
and earn my place as the head of the House of Vaud.

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
If I fail, it'll all be a lie.

16
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The Spirit Guardians won't break even if I give it my all, right?

17
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
This'll be so much fun!

18
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Yep. I'm gonna get seriously strong out there.

19
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Get as tough as you want.

20
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
I'll still be way ahead of you, Magna.

21
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,000
You wanna bet?

22
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
I have to take out Magikula and avenge my mother.

23
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
But first, I need to build up my skills.

24
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Come here.

25
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:22,680
Oh my boy

26
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
congratulations!

27
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
I wanted to know where you are with this,

28
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:32,000
and I think

29
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,000
this is a whirlwind,

30
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:38,000
this is very bright feltop Lagoon.

31
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,200
Let's approach it and just

32
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:43,700
永遠に惹かれる Shine like a diamond

33
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:57,200
天使と悪魔が交際してく

34
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:03,700
世界は矛盾だらけさ

35
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:06,200
思い通りじゃない

36
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:13,200
そのくらいで 負ける夢はダサい

37
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:16,200
そう何度も何度も

38
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:21,200
夢の前の壁を越えるさ

39
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,200
何度も何度も

40
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:27,200
弱さを未来に繋げよう

41
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:31,200
七色の日常を進め

42
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:34,200
永遠に惹かれ

43
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:37,200
You shine like a diamond

44
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:48,200
You shine like a diamond

45
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:51,200
サポートしています

46
00:02:51,200 --> 00:03:07,200
初めも awさ

47
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:10,300
All he said was, I'll get stronger with my squad.

48
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:10,920
Weird.

49
00:03:11,220 --> 00:03:14,720
Not sure why he didn't want to come with us. He obviously would have learned a lot.

50
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:19,520
Nah, Yuno's gonna get better no matter where he trains. I won't let him outdo me, though.

51
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:21,680
I see that you've all arrived.

52
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:24,280
We all appreciate the invitation, sir.

53
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,460
Come with me. The Queen is waiting.

54
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:31,580
I see a few new faces that I haven't had the pleasure of meeting.

55
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:33,820
Welcome to the Heart Kingdom.

56
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:41,860
Under normal circumstances, I would have ordered a magnificent feast to celebrate your visit, but unfortunately, it wasn't possible at this time.

57
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:44,160
It pains me that we cannot offer you more.

58
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:46,380
But please accept our greetings.

59
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:49,040
Is something wrong?

60
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:54,820
I'm sorry. I know it's rude to interrupt, but that person resting in your lap...

61
00:03:55,460 --> 00:03:57,120
Why, it's charming, obviously.

62
00:03:57,620 --> 00:04:01,500
No, trust me. We know who it is. But what the heck is she doing here?

63
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:04,220
Sure. Wherever snacks be, you'll find me!

64
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:05,180
Sounds about right.

65
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:08,220
Must the black balls always be so unprofessional?

66
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:12,600
Maybe it's not such a big deal, though. Queen Lorpechka seems to be fine with it.

67
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:15,940
Well, if it's okay with the Queen, then it's okay with me.

68
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:19,080
She seems to be pretty relaxed for a monarch, doesn't she?

69
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:22,140
I don't know if relaxed is really the word I would use.

70
00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:25,740
Brave magic knights of the Clover Kingdom, we are honored.

71
00:04:26,460 --> 00:04:28,320
It's a privilege to be in your care.

72
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,360
Yeah, thanks for having us!

73
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:34,100
Now then, about your training. Gaja, would you please explain?

74
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:40,300
The first thing you all need to know is that Spade has already captured most of the Diamond Kingdom's bases,

75
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:43,440
and that their invasion is at a standstill for right now.

76
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:49,100
In other words, it won't be long before they decide to turn their focus on us or the Clover Kingdom.

77
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:56,140
To prepare for that, we will be subjecting each of you to rigorous training in order to accelerate your development.

78
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:57,780
Sounds good to me.

79
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,300
That's not a problem.

80
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:03,080
As you've explained, it is imperative that we improve quickly.

81
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:07,460
Then allow me to introduce the spirit guardians who will be teaching you.

82
00:05:10,540 --> 00:05:12,500
Guardian of Earth, Sarado.

83
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:13,740
It's nice to meet you.

84
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,080
Guardian of Plants, Potroff.

85
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,920
Let's learn together!

86
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,080
Guardian of Fire, Floga.

87
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,640
Work up a sweat!

88
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:24,780
Guardian of Wind, Smearik.

89
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:28,200
They seem like a pretty serious crowd, huh?

90
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:31,360
Oh man, I can't decide which one of them I want to spar with most!

91
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:36,560
Captain Charlotte and Lady Mimosa, I would like you both to begin your training with Sarado.

92
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:37,860
Understood, sir.

93
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,780
We are ready.

94
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:40,620
Great, I'm looking forward to it!

95
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:43,820
Finral, you'll be learning from Smearik first.

96
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:44,560
Yes, sir!

97
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:48,720
Captain Rill, I'd like you to start with Potroff.

98
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,080
Alright, let's get to it!

99
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:51,900
I'll see you in the forest, then!

100
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:54,340
We'll be sticking to attributes for the rest of you.

101
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:56,060
The Fire Mages will work with Floga.

102
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,480
Don't go easy on me, you got that?

103
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:02,620
It seems you're both taking this seriously.

104
00:06:02,900 --> 00:06:04,660
I can't wait to meet the two of you.

105
00:06:05,180 --> 00:06:07,080
And you'll begin training with me, Luck.

106
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:10,640
As long as you put up a good fight, I don't care who I train with.

107
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:14,300
Hang on, don't you think you might be forgetting about somebody here?

108
00:06:14,980 --> 00:06:17,080
I'm sorry, but you don't possess any mana.

109
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:21,320
Spirit Guardians are gifted, but we can't create power out of nothing.

110
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,200
Huh?

111
00:06:22,200 --> 00:06:24,200
Well then, what was the point of me coming?

112
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:30,240
You're one of the Arcane Stage Mages, which means you'll give us an advantage against the Devil.

113
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:34,480
I would like you to face me in a battle, so that I can get a sense of your strength.

114
00:06:34,780 --> 00:06:37,060
After that, we will decide how best to proceed.

115
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,360
Alright, looking forward to it.

116
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,200
As for the other Arcane Stage Fighter...

117
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:44,680
I will see you to Nero's training myself.

118
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:47,880
She'll be training directly with the Queen?

119
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:50,520
I'm very excited to work with you, Nero.

120
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:54,340
Undine and I will also be overseeing Noelle's training regimen.

121
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,820
Do your best!

122
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:57,640
Right, I'm ready.

123
00:06:58,340 --> 00:07:00,440
That should cover all of our assignments.

124
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,060
Wait a second.

125
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:04,040
What's the matter, Magna?

126
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,820
Luck here.

127
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,960
You're always competing with each other.

128
00:07:08,580 --> 00:07:11,600
Any way I can train under you too, so we can keep that going?

129
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:14,020
Fine by me.

130
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:15,360
Awesome!

131
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:19,080
Well, I don't really mind, but are you sure that you can hack it?

132
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,320
Of course I can!

133
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:25,440
I should mention, none of you are permanently bound by the assignments I've chosen for you.

134
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:31,460
Once your mana grows a bit, you'll move on to a different Spirit Guardian next to see what new insights they have to offer.

135
00:07:31,460 --> 00:07:34,140
That way, you can learn even more.

136
00:07:34,940 --> 00:07:37,760
Magic Knights, your training will begin now.

137
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:39,320
Please don't let us down.

138
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,280
Right!

139
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:53,820
Magna uses Flame Magic, and Luck uses Lightning Spells.

140
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:59,400
And both of those are natural things, which is how you guys like to fight here in the Heart Kingdom, right?

141
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:02,000
Which means these two should be perfect, shouldn't they?

142
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:04,440
On a basic level, I suppose.

143
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:09,180
First, I'll show you how you can use natural mana to create mana words.

144
00:08:11,860 --> 00:08:14,100
Oh wow, what the hell is that?

145
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:16,600
It's a necessary skill for combat here.

146
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:23,320
When you build spells out of mana words, it allows you to add some simple commands into your magic techniques.

147
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,780
For example...

148
00:08:24,780 --> 00:08:24,960
Huh?

149
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:27,320
Dodge this attack.

150
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,980
Okay.

151
00:08:34,660 --> 00:08:40,600
Mana words will give the spell a more complex directive, such as become larger or pursue him.

152
00:08:40,780 --> 00:08:41,720
That's nuts.

153
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:42,960
Cool.

154
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:45,300
Yeah, I want to learn that.

155
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,460
Plants grow from the earth.

156
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:51,480
To strengthen plant-based magic, you begin with the soil.

157
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:54,640
When you put it that way, I think I get what you're saying.

158
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:57,420
You're saying the first step is understanding the earth.

159
00:08:57,700 --> 00:09:00,380
It's probably easier to explain if I give you a demonstration.

160
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:19,380
So this is what mages are capable of in the Heart Kingdom.

161
00:09:19,380 --> 00:09:24,840
Our magic attributes may be different, but we all need to be in tune with nature to use our spells.

162
00:09:25,140 --> 00:09:29,140
As soon as you have a good grasp on that, your abilities will begin to grow quite rapidly.

163
00:09:30,020 --> 00:09:31,340
That was an impressive display.

164
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:37,560
Your magic type is similar to that of one of my subordinates, but it's much faster and far more powerful than hers is.

165
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:44,620
It seems you Clover Kingdom mages rely solely on your own mana, without making use of the natural mana that always surrounds you.

166
00:09:45,340 --> 00:09:48,240
That sounds complicated, but we'll do our best.

167
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,200
How does it work?

168
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:50,060
Easy!

169
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:55,500
First you gather it all up from a big area with a cursed swoosh, then kablammo, you're good to go!

170
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:59,480
I'm sorry, but I think we'll need you to be more specific.

171
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:05,240
You sense the mana, like ding-ding-ding, then once you've got it, you have to go whoosh, you know?

172
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,620
Then we'll get into the technical stuff later.

173
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,360
I didn't get a word of that.

174
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,160
He's a little different.

175
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:26,480
The gusts from the mountains, the breeze off the ocean, it all passes through this valley.

176
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:30,320
Oh, okay. That must be why it's so windy here.

177
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:33,980
I have heard about the young man who was chosen by the wind spirit.

178
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,160
I was very eager to meet him.

179
00:10:36,620 --> 00:10:38,440
Right! You mean Asta's rival.

180
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:41,180
But then you were sent here instead.

181
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:44,100
There must be a reason. I wonder.

182
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:47,880
I mean, I'm sure Gaja just figured we'd be a good match, is all.

183
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:57,840
Well, it's your move.

184
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:07,800
Is this training?

185
00:11:08,220 --> 00:11:10,800
That's a dumb question, I know, but I really can't tell!

186
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:16,840
Whether this is for training or a real battle, the wind that blows between us remains the same.

187
00:11:17,140 --> 00:11:18,000
Don't you agree?

188
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:20,920
I can't seem to figure this guy out.

189
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,300
What is he acting so intense for?

190
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:27,200
Spatial magic is mainly meant for supporting your friends.

191
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:29,540
That is what you believe, yes?

192
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:30,960
Yeah! And?

193
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:35,500
Well then, if an enemy targets you, do you expect your friends to come to your rescue?

194
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,800
Don't be a liability.

195
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:41,620
Your purpose is greater than that.

196
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,960
What the...

197
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:49,000
What will you do now?

198
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:51,160
Let me try again!

199
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:54,920
Very well. Wherever the wind may blow.

200
00:11:54,920 --> 00:12:00,260
Ah, the weather's clear. Perfect day for training.

201
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:02,940
I look forward to working with you, Floga, sir.

202
00:12:03,500 --> 00:12:06,240
First things first, let me see your magic ability.

203
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,740
Eighty percent should do it.

204
00:12:10,660 --> 00:12:11,580
Flame magic!

205
00:12:12,700 --> 00:12:13,900
Spiral flames!

206
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:19,100
All right, if this is what you can do at eighty percent, then I'd say you've got incredible potential.

207
00:12:19,660 --> 00:12:22,760
That's nice, but if you ask me, this isn't nearly good enough.

208
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:26,260
I need to learn everything I can and get a whole lot stronger.

209
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:29,300
No way I'm gonna let this opportunity go to waste.

210
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:29,960
Understood.

211
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,720
Also, I hope this doesn't come off as rude.

212
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,960
But can you show me your powers, too?

213
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,220
Sorry, what?

214
00:12:36,580 --> 00:12:40,180
That way I can judge for myself whether I can learn much from you.

215
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,200
Ah, that makes sense.

216
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:43,320
Okay, then.

217
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:43,380
Okay, then.

218
00:12:52,760 --> 00:12:55,300
So, that answer your question?

219
00:12:56,620 --> 00:12:59,280
Yes, I should have never doubted your strength. I apologize.

220
00:13:00,060 --> 00:13:01,480
Don't worry. I don't mind.

221
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:06,200
The flame was so intense. I want to do that myself.

222
00:13:06,900 --> 00:13:09,220
Your potential is far greater than mine.

223
00:13:09,220 --> 00:13:16,080
Once you learn how to harness natural mana, you shouldn't have any problem pulling off techniques that are even more impressive than I just showed you.

224
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:18,940
You will get there.

225
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:22,680
But gaining full control over natural mana is no easy feat.

226
00:13:23,380 --> 00:13:25,540
Thank you so much for taking me under your wing!

227
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:34,000
Push! Push! You can do it!

228
00:13:34,140 --> 00:13:35,360
Oh, man, come on!

229
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:40,680
As I thought, your magic is still too weak.

230
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:41,980
Too weak?

231
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:44,380
You're about at the fifth stage.

232
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:49,340
But in order to use these techniques in battle, you'll need to reach at least third stage or higher.

233
00:13:51,020 --> 00:13:52,600
This is so much fun!

234
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:55,940
That one seems to have a knack for it.

235
00:14:00,820 --> 00:14:02,780
Guess I'll get stronger without you, then.

236
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:05,060
Wait, Magna?

237
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,820
Just leave him alone, Asta.

238
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:13,520
If he can't get any better than he is right now, then he'll never be worth anything more than that.

239
00:14:15,380 --> 00:14:16,720
Sorry to make you wait.

240
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:17,020
What?

241
00:14:17,380 --> 00:14:21,520
As I mentioned earlier, I'd like us to fight so I can get a better sense of your ability.

242
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:23,960
Attack me with all your might.

243
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:27,840
I get to fight someone who's almost on par with the Wizard King.

244
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:33,420
Then may the best man win!

245
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:40,680
This is a good spot.

246
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:42,920
So what are you going to teach me first?

247
00:14:43,060 --> 00:14:44,820
How to bask in natural mana.

248
00:14:45,500 --> 00:14:49,540
All the plants and animals, the ground, water, wind, sunlight.

249
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:53,920
This place is filled to the brim with life, which means it's also rich with mana.

250
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:58,580
Now that you say something, I think I'm already getting a feel for it.

251
00:14:58,800 --> 00:14:59,200
Good!

252
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,660
Never let go of that feeling.

253
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:03,900
You need mana words in order to master our techniques.

254
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:05,580
Listen close.

255
00:15:05,780 --> 00:15:09,560
Once you become one with natural mana, you'll be able to use those words for spells.

256
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:16,320
That's amazing.

257
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:21,900
You know, just watching the creative way that you use your magic is giving me a serious burst of inspiration.

258
00:15:22,380 --> 00:15:23,700
Then you should try it.

259
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Use mana words however your heart desires.

260
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:29,300
It might not be perfect at first, but that's fine.

261
00:15:30,560 --> 00:15:31,000
Okay.

262
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:37,580
Not bad.

263
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,500
There were no mana words, but...

264
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:42,520
The need to create is welling up inside me.

265
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:43,700
Wait, I've got an idea.

266
00:15:43,900 --> 00:15:45,520
I can see that you're an excellent painter.

267
00:15:45,820 --> 00:15:48,060
So let's try writing them this time instead.

268
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:50,720
Look, think, read, and write.

269
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:52,160
Like this?

270
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:56,240
Whoa, look at that.

271
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:57,400
Oh my.

272
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:59,900
And after only seeing them one time.

273
00:16:00,300 --> 00:16:01,640
Well, don't stop now.

274
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:04,540
No, not the painting part.

275
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,080
Thanks for your help, Potrop.

276
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:09,500
I think this masterpiece will be even better because of you.

277
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:11,220
Not the point.

278
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:18,600
Hey, you're one of the black balls, right?

279
00:16:18,940 --> 00:16:21,600
Actually, I know her as Queen Laura Petchka's pet.

280
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:22,780
Er, excuse me.

281
00:16:22,860 --> 00:16:24,240
I mean her guest, of course.

282
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:26,080
Weren't you eating back at the palace?

283
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:29,800
Well, yeah, but I kind of sort of ate everything they had there,

284
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:33,120
so I figured I might as well go searching for new and undiscovered treats.

285
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:36,400
You're saying that you devoured all of the palace's supply?

286
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:37,100
Uh-huh.

287
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,400
All right, then.

288
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:40,460
Since you traveled all this way to the Heart Kingdom,

289
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:43,480
how would you like to learn some of our special combat techniques?

290
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:48,140
That doesn't really line up with my goal of eating all the delicious noms I can find.

291
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:49,580
Aw, don't be that way.

292
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:51,660
See? Look, these are called mana words.

293
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,500
They often come in handy.

294
00:17:03,640 --> 00:17:05,880
Wow, we've got another prodigy.

295
00:17:06,300 --> 00:17:08,700
But your execution could still use some work.

296
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:12,260
The secret to that is you have to be in touch with the natural mana.

297
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:15,380
There must be more succulent fruit somewhere in these woods!

298
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:18,380
I bet if we venture a bit deeper into the forest,

299
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:21,560
I'll find some scenery that really gets my creative juices flowing!

300
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:25,420
I'm begging you, just listen to me for a few minutes, please.

301
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:31,900
Queen Laura Petschka, we're ready to learn from you and Undine.

302
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:33,200
Of course.

303
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:36,480
But first, there's something I'd like to bring to your attention.

304
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:40,200
I need you to rescue me.

305
00:17:40,980 --> 00:17:44,220
If nothing changes, I'll be killed by this curse.

306
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:45,200
And soon.

307
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:46,640
You'll be okay.

308
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,840
We'll stop the devil before that happens.

309
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:50,960
That's why we came here to train.

310
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:53,460
We are the ones who will defeat Magicula.

311
00:17:55,740 --> 00:17:58,520
Sorry, could you explain what you mean by that?

312
00:17:59,360 --> 00:18:01,840
Obviously, striking down the Spade Kingdom's invasion

313
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:05,800
will require the help of the other magic knights, but...

314
00:18:05,800 --> 00:18:07,560
Magicula's inside someone.

315
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,960
An extremely powerful mage.

316
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:11,480
Her name is Vanica.

317
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:15,660
The only way we'll even stand a chance against a foe like her

318
00:18:15,660 --> 00:18:19,060
is if Undine and I work together with the two of you.

319
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:24,700
And you already have an idea of what this Vanica person can do, is that it?

320
00:18:25,100 --> 00:18:26,540
She sounds pretty tough.

321
00:18:27,060 --> 00:18:28,840
Well, since I'm the Water Spirit,

322
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:32,860
it's my job to fight alongside the Queen and to protect her from danger.

323
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:36,520
But the two of us were no match for Vanica's astounding power.

324
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:38,560
Because of my weakness,

325
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:42,360
Her Majesty must live in fear of her impending death.

326
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:46,200
No, please don't ever blame yourself for my curse, Undine.

327
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:48,340
A person who has been possessed by a devil

328
00:18:48,340 --> 00:18:50,400
cannot be defeated by normal means.

329
00:18:51,080 --> 00:18:51,600
I get it.

330
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:53,140
So by teaming up with me and Nero,

331
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:56,560
you get some kind of special advantage that should be enough to stop her, right?

332
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:59,360
We can't be sure of that just yet.

333
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:02,960
But I've come to the conclusion that the four of us working together

334
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:05,540
creates the best possible scenario for victory.

335
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:10,320
Noelle, I hope the two of you will agree to cooperate with us

336
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,940
and save Lorpechka's life.

337
00:19:12,580 --> 00:19:14,680
With Nero's arcane stage spells

338
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:17,640
and your combative spirit and fighting style.

339
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:21,100
If we four train hard,

340
00:19:21,420 --> 00:19:23,520
then we'll become a formidable team.

341
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:24,700
And then hopefully,

342
00:19:25,220 --> 00:19:27,860
we can overpower Vanica and Megicula.

343
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:30,500
All of that makes sense to me.

344
00:19:31,340 --> 00:19:33,160
Nero, can we count you in too?

345
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:35,080
We're grateful.

346
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:36,580
No need for that.

347
00:19:37,020 --> 00:19:37,580
Trust me.

348
00:19:38,140 --> 00:19:41,500
I've my own reasons for wanting to be the one to kill Megicula.

349
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:41,860
Good.

350
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:43,920
Then we agree.

351
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:45,640
Let's begin our training.

352
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:50,420
Go ahead and don't hold back!

353
00:20:02,860 --> 00:20:04,300
That's the right idea.

354
00:20:05,060 --> 00:20:07,680
But if you can't figure out your opponent's attacks,

355
00:20:07,860 --> 00:20:09,160
it won't help you.

356
00:20:09,780 --> 00:20:10,980
Come on, Finral.

357
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:13,100
You can't support anybody like this.

358
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:21,940
Great work, ladies.

359
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:24,280
Just keep on using those monowords.

360
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:26,580
I know you'll get the hang of it eventually.

361
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:42,740
Gotcha this time!

362
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:52,700
The power to invalidate magic is second to nothing.

363
00:20:52,700 --> 00:20:56,200
But you're too narrow-minded to use it to its full potential.

364
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:57,700
I'm not done!

365
00:20:57,700 --> 00:21:11,560
A fighting style that relies solely on your grit and determination is not enough to sustain you forever.

366
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:19,020
To truly unleash your abilities, it's only logical that you use them to back up your allies as well.

367
00:21:19,460 --> 00:21:21,080
Let me try one more time!

368
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:24,840
I suppose you won't be satisfied with that advice alone.

369
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:33,440
Day one and they're already running me ragged.

370
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:36,320
And it's not just me, it's all of us.

371
00:21:36,320 --> 00:21:38,620
So, are you seeing any progress?

372
00:21:39,620 --> 00:21:43,480
It looks like everybody's gotten the hang of the Heart Kingdom's special techniques.

373
00:21:43,920 --> 00:21:48,520
If it's like this every day, I'd be surprised if we weren't crazy tough at the end.

374
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:49,100
Great.

375
00:21:49,100 --> 00:21:50,960
Well, keep it up, then.

376
00:21:51,300 --> 00:21:51,620
Right.

377
00:21:53,300 --> 00:21:56,520
Looks like they're all working hard to push past their limits.

378
00:21:57,280 --> 00:21:59,880
So, I guess I better up my game as well.

379
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:29,860
Well, keep it up.

380
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:35,680
Stop it.

381
00:22:36,160 --> 00:22:37,840
Hey.

382
00:22:41,980 --> 00:22:48,680
This is a living for you.

383
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:52,620
If you want to see a while, you greed, trust the blood at the end.

384
00:22:52,660 --> 00:22:53,620
spar Docs

385
00:22:53,620 --> 00:22:56,460
Love suit

386
00:22:57,100 --> 00:22:58,320
or

387
00:22:58,320 --> 00:23:02,120
全然届かなくても

388
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:04,980
信じる君はあがいて前を向いている

389
00:23:04,980 --> 00:23:09,000
だから枯れないようにやらがって

390
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:12,000
描いた夢また歩き出せる

391
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:15,040
きっと僕を呼ぶ声だ

392
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:18,220
しまして

393
00:23:22,140 --> 00:23:22,600
僕を呼ぶ声だ

394
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:26,460
我々は

395
00:23:28,320 --> 00:23:40,420
Since everybody's out there working their butts off, the hideout's actually quiet for once.

396
00:23:41,300 --> 00:23:44,680
Black Clover, page 156, Awakening Powers.

397
00:23:45,180 --> 00:23:49,440
I'm pushing as hard as I can, and I don't mean in the john, you idiot.

